      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m still not sure I understand the overall use case here, but if this is for vendor modules to specify the version of the vndk snapshot they should compile against, would something more specific like \"vndk_version\" make more sense?",
      "revId": "fb23bae736b9e689a3cf776cd296e7df3288566c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
